# Speak Action - TTS synthesis and playback

# Goal
string text
string language
float32 speed
float32 pitch
bool interrupt_current      # Interrupt current playback

---
# Result
bool success
uint16 error_code
string message
builtin_interfaces/Time actual_duration

---
# Feedback
float32 progress_percent    # Synthesis progress
bool is_synthesizing        # Is synthesizing
bool is_playing             # Is playing
